IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `oas-core`
IMPORT `oas-core-measures`

-- Old Age Security Regulations (C.R.C., c. 1246), piece oa3. HELPERS.
--
-- Nothing in this module is a provision of the Regulations. It holds the two small pieces of date
-- arithmetic that more than one module of piece oa3 needs ("the latest of", "the later of") and that the
-- shared core does not have; they are labelled `oa3:` so that no other piece can define the same name.
-- No `@ref` is written because no provision licenses them (the same convention as oas-core-measures).

GIVEN a IS A DATE
      b IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`oa3: the later of` a `and` b MEANS
    IF a AT LEAST b THEN a ELSE b

GIVEN a IS A DATE
      b IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`oa3: the earlier of` a `and` b MEANS
    IF a AT MOST b THEN a ELSE b
